            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.1+2KI.15.2+2KI.15.3+2KI.15.4+2KI.15.5+2KI.15.6+2KI.15.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 15.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "15.32–16.20; 18.1–20.21; 2 Int 26.1–32.33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enduaata e Isaya olayioni le Amos, apa natoduaa, naipirta Yuda o Yerusalem, too nkolong'i e Usia, o Yotam, o Ahas, o Hesekia, aiguanak le Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eisikong'a Enkai iltung'ana lenyena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toning'o, iyie keper, ninchoru enkiok na kop; amu eiroro Olaitoriani: “Aitotio nanu nkera naitubulu, naatogolong'akitia ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyiolo olkiteng olopeny, neyiolo osikiria ewueji neitotiyieki kake meyiolo ninye Israel, mening ninche iltung'ana laainei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, olosho loo laing'okok, olorere onapita enkarruoisho, eishoi oo larruok, ilayiok oas inemeitoriori! Etung'uatie ninche Olaitoriani, etemenaitie ninche ilo sinyati le Israel, etapong'ori ninche tukul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo pee iyieuu neoshi intae, eji metaa ipuopuo dukuya aagolong'u? Kemuei endukuya pooki, neiterre oltau pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ebaiki entutunyo e nkeju o metabaiki endukuya, metii embiotisho, kake ilbaa, o ltuduta, o ngoldonyot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ngoldonyot",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "inchere impaldakani, ilbaa oirrokirrok",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naaruko nkimek; neitu eironyuni, aashu eeni, neitu eelieki eilata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirragita enkop inyi aa mijooni, netapejoyioki nkanas inyi te nkima; te dukuya intae idolitata einosa iltung'ana leeiking'a enkop inyi; netomijoono ninye, anaa ina nainyala iltung'ana leeiking'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etung'uayioki ina tito e Sion anaa olng'obor ti atua enkurma oo sabibu, anaa olkirragarie ti atua enkurma e entoki naaijo nkaimalasia anaa enkanasa natang'aduaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 19.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 9.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Te neme Olaitoriani loo lororani otelekaka iyiook oloti pisiai, anaata kitotiutuo anaa Sodom, nikitiu anaa Gomora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoning ororei lo Laitoriani, intae ilaitoriak le Sodom! Enchoo enkiok enkiteng'enare e Nkai ang intae iltung'ana le Gomora! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.21+AMO.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 5.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kainyoo te nanu enkumoi oo lasarri linyi? Olaitoriani ojo; Ataraposhe nanu ilasarri oopejori loo lmerregeshi o eilata e lelo kerra linyi oopir; mashipakino nanu osarge loo loing'ok, aashu loo lkerra aashu o loo lkineji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore oshi ti nipuonunu aaitalioo ate te dukuya nanu, aing'ae naikilikuan intae nipuonunu aaituny ndung'orot aainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mintokiki aayau ilasarri le pesho; olminong enkorropil te nanu. Ore olapa ng'ejuk o sabato o enkipototo e umata - maidim nanu aing'ura ena torroni o eumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo apaitin linyi ng'ejuko o lelo siruai linyi oogeluno, keiba oltau lai; netaa ninche olola te nanu, atanaure anapita ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti nintorioo nkaik inyi, naisudoo nkonyek aainei te ntae; ore hoo niomonono katitin kumok, mainining nanu; ebore nkaik inyi osarge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entukuo ate, entobira ate; ewuang'ie entorroni oo nkiaasin inyi, te dukuya nkonyek aainei; entapal entorroni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "entamoo ate easata oo mbaa sidain; eng'oru esipata, entobira enkibookinoto e nkop, entomitu ilo okishi, entasaru ina nara enkoliai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wou naa matoning'oto te nebo, Olaitoriani ojo; ore hoo neyia ing'ok inono anaa enkarasha nanyokie, keyooki aaiboru netiu anaa enkatampoi naibor oleng ore hoo nedo anaa osarge, keyooki aaiborru anaa ilpapit loo ntare naaibor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti ninyoraa nirukuruku, ninosinoso olkar le nkop; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake ti niaanyianya nigolong'ung'u, nemuti intae to lalem; amu enkutuk o Laitoriani nairoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ina anasa oo ng'ok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaji eikuna ina anasa naisiligayu, pee etaa enaibor onyek, ore apa ina nabore esipata! Naa enkiguana nasipa naton ti atua ninye, kake ore taata netaa ilarak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etaa enkosholai ino isuut, netushulare enaisho ino enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkituaak linono netogolong'utua, naa ile ncholiek oo lapurrok. Nenyor ake pooki te ninche eropare nekuet aasujaa nkishorot. Memitu ninche ilo okishi, nemeshilaa ninche enyamali oo nkolia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, Olaitoriani ojo, Olaitoriani loo lororani, ilo magilani le Israel: “Ee kaitalaku nanu engoro ai too lmang'ati laainei, kaitalaku nanu makewan te lelo laaiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaaipirakinye nanu enkaina ai Naasil anaa enasil olkunoni esekenkei naiwuang'ie nanu oloirerio lino pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitasheyie nanu ilarishak linyi anaa apake, o lelo arikok linyi anaa apake te nkiterunoto. Ore te siadi ina neaku eikiji, enkanasa e supatisho, ina anasa naisiligayu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kekorduni Sion te sipata, ore lelo ootii atua nekorduni te supatisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore lelo oogolong'u o laing'okok, neidaikieki te nebo, ore lelo ootanyaita Olaitoriani nemuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu iyookiki aakurru te nkaraki lelo keek apa laaijo ilng'abolo lishipakinono, neitukurruni intae te nena kurman apa nitegelutua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu iyookiki intae aatiu anaa olchani onyaanyukie olng'aboli otoyu mbenek enyena, aashu anaa nkurman nemetii enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo tung'ani ogol netiu anaa suut, ore esiaai enye netiu anaa suut naapiki enkima neyupuyup te nebo, nemeetae oltung'ani oidim aibooi ina kima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
